window.products.push({"id":1117038,"name":"DriftAway Twyla Linen Blend Blackout Tie Up Curtain for Kitchen Boho Floral Printed Tie Up Shade for Bedroom Adjustable Balloon Rod Pocket 45 Inch by ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rV1e6yPhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Linen Blend READY MADE: 1-piece printed lined tie up window curtain, measures 45” wide and 63” long, constructed with 3” Rod Pocket on top. Easy to install. PREMIUM FABRIC: This expensive-looking tie up curtain is crafted from open weave linen blend fabric and premier workmanship, sturdy and durable, soft but still rustic, no loose threads. Primitive and natural effect make the tie up curtain more draped and aesthetic. The premium tie up curtain made of linen blended fabric adds more romance and elegance to your decor. STYLISH DESIGN: The graceful Twyla bohemian style floral flower patterns are adorned with ivory gray color so that looks very soft and natural, gives the chic design a classic look. This timeless floral printed linen blend tie up curtain with soft color scheme will blend and complement all of your existing décor, will be a perfectly trendy choice for your bedroom, living room, dining room, office or any space. EASY ADJUST & SERVE WELL: Our Twyla linen blend tie up curtain is easy to adjust to the height per your need for shading and privacy protection, features high performance on light reducing, thermal insulating, noise reducing, energy saving / efficiency, leading to better temperature regulation of the room. Efficiently prevent cold and heat from the outside to increase the energy efficiency of your home, CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Machine Wash Cold, Gentle Cycle, only non-chlorine bleach when needed, tumble dry low, cool iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rV1e6yPhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DriftAway","source_asin":"B0B6W41FNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6W41FNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6W41FNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1117039,"name":"Jim Shore Heartwood Creek Poodle Figurine, 4-3/4-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hs-N83WAL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The unmistakable “heartcrafted” style of Jim Shore’s Heartwood Creek ® collection captures the essence of traditional themes and motifs of American and European folk art. Each piece features a variety of quilting patterns and colorful combinations making it distinctly special. The artist, Jim Shore: “I can’t imagine myself ever tiring of this. The variety keeps me inspired and it’s just plain fun to look at!” Initially Jim Shore pursued his art when and where he could. Supporting his young family as an engineer, he honed his skills as a sculptor and painter in his spare time. His passion was always his art, which ultimately led to the start of his own company. Jim has also perfected his technique in silver and gold-smithing, wood carving, stained glass, furniture making and sculpting in stone. But, it’s his recollection of nostalgic childhood memories and his deep appreciation of handcrafted quilt patterns and textures that inspires Jim’s works-of-art. The magic of Jim’s design style is that it can be partnered with a variety of licensed brands. His partnerships with Disney®, Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer® and Boyds® all showcase the traditional characters and icons in a style that can only be achieved by Jim Shore. Each piece touches the heart of the enthusiast through creativity and nostalgia. A cute poodle designed with the traditional Heartwood Creek patterning. The poodle is ranked #9 in the 2011AKC survey of top breeds owned in the US.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hs-N83WAL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jim Shore Heartwood Creek","source_asin":"B006JAIB2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006JAIB2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006JAIB2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
