window.products.push({"id":1117450,"name":"MosJos Gallon Beverage Dispenser - Cactus Embossed Drink Dispensers for Parties - Easy-fill Bail and Trigger Lid with Locking Clamp for Lemonde, Sun T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sh-MhyCJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MosJos Cactus Embossed Drink Dispenser: A Gallon of Beverages at Your FingertipsDo you need fast and reliable access to drinks? Does the thought of garnishing a gallon of beverages with fresh, juicy fruits and ice on a warm day sound irresistible? As a practical glass water dispenser for your home or something with more of a kick for outdoor parties, this glass beverage dispenser with spigot won't disappoint!The dispenser sits firmly on countertops and tables. The spigot steadily fills up empty cups. The gallon water dispenser capacity means less time wasted on refills and more time enjoying drinks! The bail and trigger lid adds extra charm to this vibrant cactus-themed dispenser. It won't take long to enjoy popping open the locking clamp lid and hearing the sound of your favorite drinks gushing through the wide opening as you prepare your next gallon of delicious beverages!Find out Why This Gallon Dispenser is the Perfect Choice for Your Home: ✓ Unique Drink Dispenser Design: An embossed cactus immediately creates summer vibes. ✓ Premium Glass Construction: The solid glass design promises years of high-quality performance. ✓ Simple Dispensing Spigot: Press back the spigot, and your beverages will steadily flow out. ✓ Drink Versatility: From a delicious sun tea jar to fruity sangria and everything in between, this dispenser is perfect for cool drinks. ✓ Bail and Trigger Lid: The strong locking clamp provides secure opening and closure in seconds.The Perfect Addition for Parties, Picnics, Barbecues, Weddings, and More!Forget the flimsy plastic bottles and glass bowls than make serving drinks a chore! This dispenser quickly gets everyone into the party mood. The transparent glass design looks stunning against a garnished display of colorful drinks. The wide opening allows for plenty of refreshing ice and fruity chunks to leave everyone wanting more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sh-MhyCJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MosJos","source_asin":"B0B7289GYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7289GYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7289GYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
