window.products.push({"id":1117525,"name":"OKD Storage Cabinet, Farmhouse Bathroom Cabinet Organizer w/Adjustable Shelves, Narrow Kitchen Pantry w/Barn Door, Versatile Storage w/Hanging Rod for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712IRT70GQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FARMHOUSE CABINET WITH THOUGHTFUL DESIGN BEHIND: Product Measured: 20\"D × 16\"W × 72\"H. Our Depth is 20 Inches which differs from most cabinets that vary from 11''D to 16''D in the market. This 18'' inner depth enables you to hang overcoats and T-shirts avoiding wrinkles and extrusion. As for the design, It features a perfect blend of modern & farmhouse. The reclaimed barnwood color finish delivers a naturally aged feel and creates a cozy and retro vibe. Enhancing its charm: barn door design with dark iron-tone hardware. This new OKD narrow storage cabinet can fit well in any space in your home and matches perfectly with other OKD farmhouse furniture. ROOMY AND VERSATILE for STORAGE to MAKE YOUR SPACE ORGANIZATIONALLY & DECORATIVELY. There are 2 cabinets that house 2 shelves adjustable &removable with 3 heights to fit items of different sizes, providing customizable organization for lines, food & snacks, cleansing tools, or clothes. Featuring a removable metal hanging rod for hanging clothes or other supplies. Closing the aesthetic barn door for a clean, organized look. It can work as a craft storage organizer in your living room, or as bathroom storage, a wardrobe in your bedroom, a food pantry in your kitchen, or broom & cleansing tools storage for your laundry room BUILT TO LAST: Constructed with premium engineered wood and metal, featuring a durable laminate finish and well-structured design. Our single-barn-door storage cabinet weighs 105 lbs which are 30% heavier comparing others since we applied high-density boards for the structure. This OKD organizer is built to withstand the challenges of long-term use. The bottom shelf can hold up to 50 lbs and the other 3 shelves support up to 30 lbs each. EASY ASSEMBLY: All parts, hardware kits, and clear instructions for the OKD storage cabinet. Each screw and pin has its own code and boards are clearly labeled to let you easily understand the assembly progress. Since the cabinet weighs 105 lbs, It requires 2 people to complete the assembly in about 60 mins. WARM ALERTS FOR SAFETY: If you have kids or animals that like to climb things, We do highly suggest using the wall anchor and bracket the package comes with PACKAGE AND SERVICE: This farmhouse cabinet will be shipped directly from our US LOCAL WAREHOUSE. It is packaged in a secure box that contains foam and protective boards surrounding to prevent damage. In case of any problem or you are not satisfied, please contact us without hesitation, we always reply within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712IRT70GQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OKD","source_asin":"B0BL353LBB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL353LBB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL353LBB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
