window.products.push({"id":1117621,"name":"Trim-It-Quick Complete Tree Lighting Kit 6' - 7.5' Tree, LED, 9 Custom Multi-Strand Light Sets, 650 Lights, Multi-Outlet Extension Cord, Ideal for Chr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RKlBjx+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Trim-It-Quick complete and easy lighting kit for live and artificial trees features the patented Trim-It-Quick (TIQ) 6-strand designed light sets.  Each TIQ light set is constructed with a hook for holding strands in place for easy positioning.  Different from the traditional light sets, the 6-strand design readily adapts to the natural contours of tree branches. Kit Includes: 1-18” light set (50ct) 5-35” light sets (60ct) 3-47” light sets (100ct) 1-9 outlet (9’) extension cord with on/off switch. 650 total lights. FEATURES Instant trunk to tip density Vibrant dense coverage without winding back and forth Each branch has it's own light strand Eliminates unsightly crossover from branch to branch Enhancement lighting or replacement lighting for pre-lit trees. Indoor/Outdoor uses BENEFITS The first complete lighting kit for trees designed to simplify the decorating experience. Trim-It-Quick takes the guesswork out of shopping for Christmas tree lights. Trim-It-Quick’s patented 6-strand design comes in 4 lengths to ensure a custom fit for various sized trees. Looks professionally decorated with less effort Quick removal and stores away neatly year after year Tangle-resistant due to shorter strands","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RKlBjx+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harlan's Trim It Quick","source_asin":"B07K9P83Q7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K9P83Q7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K9P83Q7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
