window.products.push({"id":1117653,"name":"Fabulous-Furs Donna Salyers Faux-Fur Throw Pillow, Plush Accent Pillow, 18x18 in, Grey Rabbit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":100.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SjLi8E2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With more than 30 years of experience in crafting luxury faux-fur fashion, Donna Salyers knows you never have to sacrifice compassion for style. Donna Salyers’ Fabulous-Furs faux-fur throw-pillow collection brings you this gorgeous square faux-fur throw pillow to elevate any space in your home. Perfect for a cozy reading corner or lounging on a California King, this decor piece is as comfortable and functional as is it beautiful.Made from synthetic textile fibers, this faux-fur pillow cover features a removable sham that unzips from the square 100% polyester pillow body for easy care. Whether you need a decorative pillow for a couch, bed, or armchair, you’ll get unique, conscientious home decor that is easy to care for.This faux-fur pillowcase is durable enough for you to wash it at home, so you can skip the expensive dry-cleaning bill, even after multiple uses. Care Instructions: Machine wash in cold water and line dry or air fluff. Do not iron, wash with bleach, or use heat.More than 30 years ago, the Donna Salyers’ Fabulous-Furs brand began with a passion for animals, needles, and thread and a desire for cruelty-free fashion. Our fabrics and materials are crafted from the most natural-looking, visually and texturally exquisite textiles, and every piece in our collection receives personal attention, from the design table to the sewing room and from our hands to yours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SjLi8E2eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fabulous-Furs","source_asin":"B0B135GKHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B135GKHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B135GKHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1117654,"name":"Instant Perrrt! | Premium Steamer Basket | Perfectly Prepares Vegetables, Eggs, Meats & More | Instant Pot Pressure Cooker Accessory | Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zlxdJjeFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSTAPOT FRIENDLY: Custom built to fit 3 quart Instant Pots and larger so you can easily insert and remove our basket with your delicious foods in tow. Even though it’s designed for pressure cookers, this basket works great with your pot of choice. No need to modify and break anything to finally have a steamer basket accessory that fits your pot like a glove. SAFE & SECURE: Don't risk spilled food with those non-sturdy one handle baskets - our patent pending convenient 2 handle design allows you to cook and steam foods without making a mess while picking up the basket with choices like chicken, eggs, vegetables and soup bones. Make sure to pick up with oven mitts to ensure safety! PREMIUM QUALITY: We made sure to only use the highest 304 grade stainless steel for you and your family's safety while other cheaper products are using inferior materials that can rust or leach into your food. Our basket is built not to rust or fall apart with normal use and will not stain over time MULTIFUNCTIONAL USE: Not only is our steamer basket perfect for veggies, hard cooked eggs, seafood, and meats. It can also be used as a stainless steel strainer for very fast straining or fruit container, as the design allows you to lift the steamer basket out instead of using a separate colander to drain whatever you want to. DISHWASHER SAFE: We know that this is just what you've been looking for, so that’s why we took it one step further. Our basket is dishwasher safe and easy to clean. Just make sure to dry after washing so as to not leave water spots on your beautiful stainless finish. And now you’ve got a perfect solution for your pressure cooker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zlxdJjeFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Instant Perrrt!","source_asin":"B07CYF6GYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CYF6GYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CYF6GYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
