window.products.push({"id":1117682,"name":"BICMTE Curtain Holdbacks 2 Pack Tiebacks for Curtains Holders Hooks Drapes Pull Backs Diamond Shiny Metal Feather Wing Style with High Elastic Spring ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wk5exURQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fine Craftsmanship】: The spring curtain tiebacks are made of high-quality metal, the innovative and flexible stainless steel spring clip is fully elastic and durable, and can be stretched to fit curtains of different thicknesses, the feathery design is simple and beautiful on the outside and have a glossy texture, bring an artistic touch to your living area and perfectly decorate your curtains. 【No drilling and installation required】: The metal feather curtain hook is very easy to install. You only need to unfold the curtain tie back and wrap the curtain to achieve the effect of fixing the curtain. You don't need to use tools or drill holes in the wall, so the curtain backstop won't damage the wall. This new curtain clip is a great alternative to wall hanging hooks, you don't have to worry about too many curtain hooks hurting your child. 【Multi-scene application】: The curtain holdback is stable and durable, no other tools are needed to fix curtains, it is an essential accessory for living room, bedroom, kitchen, dining room, bathroom, home, office, cafe, balcony, etc. To decorate your life . 【Package includes】: 2 curtain buckle. The diameter of the curtain buckle is about 6cm and the weight is about 67g, which is more novel and simple than the ordinary curtain lace-up design. With this delicate curtain clip, it can add extra elegance to your room. 【Sales service】: We want you to be completely satisfied with our products. You get 100% customer support for this product. For a better shopping experience, please feel free to contact us with any questions. and we offer full refund or replacement service for any quality problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wk5exURQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BICMTE","source_asin":"B0BJPRMRV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJPRMRV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJPRMRV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1117683,"name":"Riedel Sommeliers Black Stemless Montrachet/Chardonnay Wine Tumbler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JKZK25HKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Designed and produced by world-renowned Austrian glassmakers, this Riedel Sommeliers Black Stemless Chardonnay Wine Tumbler features a unique combination of the sophisticated functionality found in Riedel's own Sommeliers blind tasting glass, along with the innovative and trendy style of the Riedel O stemless series. This glass is quite stylish with its opaque black body, making it perfect for blind wine tasting parties or doubling as fine drinkware for your table. This glass is designed to enhance the flavors of a rich, full Chardonnay, and comes attractively packed in a handsome gift tube. Amazon.com After the great success of Riedel's first jet-black blind tasting glass, the company has come out with a number of black tasting glasses in the top-shelf Sommeliers collection that take the popular O tumbler form. The opaque black glass hides not only the color of the wine (many oenophiles can't tell a white from a red when the color is not apparent), but the clarity, sediment, and depth of the wine, forming a double-blind test. However, these new black tumblers also make a bold contemporary statement and work fabulously for casual yet appreciative wine drinking. And, the stemless design means breakage is kept to a minimum. True to the Riedel philosophy of shaping and sizing a glass to suit a particular wine, this black tumbler is designed voluminously to capture the aroma of whites such as Chardonnay and Montrachet. The glass is hand-blown of 24 percent lead crystal, holds 23-3/4 ounces at full capacity, and comes packaged in a handsome gift tube. Like all fine crystal, the glass should be washed by hand. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JKZK25HKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riedel","source_asin":"B0009303U0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009303U0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009303U0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
