window.products.push({"id":1117700,"name":"COLLAGE.COM Custom Photo Sherpa Blanket with Simply Family Script | Add Your Own Picture to Create Customized Bedspread Gifts & Personalized Blankets ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aqu2AezJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Customized Your Way - Family is everything, with our Family script custom photo blanket you can create a keepsake for your family to share for generations to come! Our photo blankets have been featured as perfect gifts and decor everywhere from \"Good Morning America\" and \"The View\" to AARP: The Magazine, Forbes, Mashable and Buzzfeed. 5 Material Options - Our fleece blanket provides sharp photo quality, perfect for displaying memories, Cozy fleece is printed on a soft longer-pile fleece blanket for snuggling, the sherpa offers beautiful, sharp images on the front and a cozy soft sherpa fleece backing. With our woven blankets, your design is woven directly into this 100% cotton blanket with tasseled edges. Our outdoor blanket has a waterproof backside and handy carrying strap, ideal for picnics, ball games, and beach days. Give the Gift of Cozy - Make special throw blankets for holiday entertaining, or birthday presents with your favorite family photos from the last year. Design an elegant blanket you can’t buy at the store with stylish custom patterns and a monogram to make sure everyone knows it’s yours. The perfect gifts for any couple, mom, dad, boyfriend or girlfriend! Customize a blanket in your favorite team’s colors to show your support while keeping warm at cold hockey and football games. Why choose Collage.com? - We provide the easiest experience to help you turn your photos into memories. Whether you're designing a collage or printing a single image, creating the perfect custom product is fast, easy and fun. Easy Care and USA Printed - Machine wash, tumble dry. Your blanket will be even snugglier after washing!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aqu2AezJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLLAGE.COM","source_asin":"B08BHXC2TV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHXC2TV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHXC2TV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
