window.products.push({"id":1117953,"name":"Crazy Genie Waterproof 10 Led Solar Powered Lights Outdoor String Lights for Gardens, Homes, Wedding, Christmas, Party (Warm White # 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pnSncz0gL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This wonderful outdoor and indoor use string light is an Environment-friendly products, converting the solar energy into electricity and high energy conversion rate sealed process. It built in 600mah NIMH replaceable battery, and is solar charged the only. Put under sunshine during the day, and it begins to light up at night automatically. 2 different modes: flash and steady on. Perfect for indoor and outdoor decoration, such as gardens, patio, lawn, porch, gate, yard, etc.   Specifications:  Light color: warm white  Charging time: 8hours.  Working time: 6-8hours,total working time more than 10,000hours  Switch: power on/off  Led quantity: 10pcs  Globe diameter: 0.13ft(40mm)  Flash mode: steady on or flashing  Solar panel: 2V 100MA  Working temperature: -20degree -60degree  Total Length of String: 3.35m(11ft)   Attention: The work time will be effect by the weather condition,the season and the location. It is normal, because the conversion efficiency of solar panel is effected by the light intensity. The lamp string will be charged only it's in \"on\" mode. It is waterproof, but limited by rain and moisture.(it can not stay too long in the water.) Huge impact and knock must be avoided, otherwise, it will be damaged. One side of the spike is very sharp, please be carefully when you are using.STAY IT AWAY FROM CHILDREN AS IT IS SHARP.   Package Included:  1 x Solar Panel ,1 x 21 cm Spike ,1 x 10 LED Solar String Morocco Globe Lights.  Package size: 6.7*3.15*3.55inch","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pnSncz0gL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crazy Genie","source_asin":"B015PMJ0LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1117953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015PMJ0LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015PMJ0LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
